        <summary>
          <para>Usage that occurs while this network is not a default network.</para>
          <para>This implies that the app responsible for this usage requested that it occur on a specific network different from the one(s) the system would have selected for it.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/usage/NetworkStats.Bucket#DEFAULT_NETWORK_NO" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.app.usage.NetworkStats.Bucket.DEFAULT_NETWORK_NO</code>.</a></format></para>
